Another Pandora Bingo game-play idea:

Gong-show Pandora Bingo

Each Player picks 10 songs in the genre.
Each player receives 1 point for each of their songs that plays. First one to a designated number of points wins (the default is 5). 10 is the max for now.
They also pick 5 Gong songs.
These Gong songs act to cancel out another players points if the other player would have been awarded points for that song.
All song selections remain secret to other players until it is played.Optionally, after a person has picked their songs, the selections are also kept hidden from themselves until it is played. This way people might forget what they chose and be surprised when the are awared points or Gonged out.